==Strategy==
Having spammable Area-Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and anti-Red units like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] here will do a great job at clearing the horde of Gato Amigos and Nyandam. Remember that you shouldn't push too much into Nyandam's range until the waves of Gato Amigo begin to slow down. Money in this stage shouldn't be an issue, since the Gato Amigos provide a surprisingly high amount of cash.
If you somehow obtained [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] by this point, this stage becomes a joke with the help of Research Combos like [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] + [[Mini-Saurus (Combo)|Mini-Saurus]]/[[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]].

